WEBVTT

00:19:59.871 --> 00:20:04.329
and they're shaping its future. Learn
more Morgan Stanley dotcoms, people.

00:20:18.496 --> 00:20:21.579
Extracting ourselves from our own
bad decisions is hard enough.

00:20:21.996 --> 00:20:24.163
Our ego and our image are in danger,

00:20:24.913 --> 00:20:27.246
but escalation is even worse
when it happens.

00:20:27.246 --> 00:20:29.496
An entire teams or organizations.